{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "grp-stage1",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 1 | Edge Operational Domains & Latency Budgets",
      "x": -1360,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage1-gpu",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\ude80 STAGE 1A | GPU Acceleration Domain\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/gpu-deployment/00-gpu-deployment-moc|Open GPU Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n\n### Optimization Paradigm\n- **Target Platforms**: NVIDIA Ada Lovelace, Blackwell, Jetson Orin/Thor\n- **Techniques**: CUDA Streams, FP8/FP16 Tensor Cores, Graph Capture\n- **Throughput Objective**: Sub-millisecond deep vision inference\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/gpu-deployment/README|GPU Deployment Playbook]]",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage1-fpga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 STAGE 1B | FPGA Acceleration Domain\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/fpga-deployment/00-fpga-deployment-moc|Open FPGA Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n\n### Spatial Compute Mechanics\n- **Target Platforms**: AMD Versal Gen 2, Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoC\n- **Techniques**: Custom DPU Cores, FINN Streaming Dataflow, INT4/INT8 PTQ\n- **Throughput Objective**: Bounded microsecond latency with zero thermal throttling\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/fpga-deployment/README|FPGA Hardware Synthesis Playbook]]",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage1-rt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u23f1\ufe0f STAGE 1C | Hard Real-Time Systems\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/real-time-systems/00-real-time-systems-moc|Open Real-Time Systems MOC \u2197]]**\n\n### Deterministic Operating Systems\n- **Target Latency**: P99 jitter $<50\\ \\mu\\text{s}$, control loop $<10\\text{ ms}$\n- **Stack**: Linux PREEMPT_RT, Lock-Free Rings, ISO 26262 ASIL-D certification\n- **Guarantees**: Formal schedulability bounds via Liu & Layland analysis\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/real-time-systems/README|Real-Time Systems Playbook]]",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage2",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 2 | DL Compilers & Acceleration Frameworks",
      "x": -680,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage2-trt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f RUNTIME | NVIDIA TensorRT 10\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[frameworks/tensorrt|Open TensorRT Framework Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Deep Learning Inference Compiler\n- **Optimization**: Kernel fusion, dynamic memory planning, FP8/FP16 auto-tuning\n- **Graph Compilation**: Ahead-of-Time (AOT) serialization to `.engine` binaries\n- **Performance**: $<0.25\\text{ ms}$ ResNet-50, $<1.15\\text{ ms}$ RF-DETR on modern GPUs\n- **License**: NVIDIA Proprietary EULA / Apache-2.0 Parsers",
      "x": -640,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage2-ort",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f RUNTIME | ONNX Runtime (ORT)\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[frameworks/onnxruntime|Open ONNX Runtime Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Cross-Platform Execution Provider (EP)\n- **Hardware EPs**: CUDA, TensorRT, OpenVINO, Qualcomm QNN, DirectML\n- **Memory Efficiency**: Direct device IOBinding eliminates host-to-device CPU copies\n- **Speedup**: $1.85\\times$ end-to-end latency reduction in streaming pipelines\n- **License**: MIT Commercial Permissive License",
      "x": -640,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage2-vulkansc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f RUNTIME | Vulkan SC 2.0\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[frameworks/vulkan-sc|Open Vulkan SC Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Safety-Critical Compute Engine\n- **Safety Standard**: ISO 26262 ASIL-D & DO-178C avionics certification\n- **Static Design**: Offline pipeline caching (PCC) with zero runtime memory allocations\n- **Hardware Neutral**: Deterministic compute on discrete GPUs, NPUs, and DSPs\n- **License**: Khronos Open Standard",
      "x": -640,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage3",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 3 | Engine Compilation & Zero-Overhead Cookbooks",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage3-cudagraphs",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfaf STAGE 3A | TensorRT 10 & CUDA Graphs\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/16-tensorrt-cuda-graphs/README|Open Cookbook 16 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Eliminating Driver Launch Overhead\n- **Graph Capture**: Replaces sequential CUDA kernel launches with single `cudaGraphLaunch`\n- **Host Memory**: Pre-allocated zero-copy page-locked pinned memory (`cudaHostAlloc`)\n- **Performance**: $<0.60\\text{ ms}$ ($1,724\\text{ FPS}$ on RTX 5090 Blackwell)\n- **Zero Dynamic Allocations**: Guarantees zero runtime heap jitter",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage3-iobinding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udd04 STAGE 3B | ONNX Runtime IOBinding\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/23-onnxruntime-iobinding/README|Open Cookbook 23 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Direct GPU Buffer Mapping\n- **IOBinding Semantics**: Pre-allocates native GPU memory buffers bound directly to OrtValue\n- **Overhead Elimination**: Eliminates Python/C++ boundary memory duplication\n- **Speedup**: $1.85\\times$ end-to-end latency reduction in live video pipelines\n- **Safety**: Verified contiguous buffer alignment prevents segmentation faults",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage3-quark",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 STAGE 3C | AMD Quark Versal PTQ\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/17-amd-quark-versal-ptq/README|Open Cookbook 17 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Post-Training Quantization (PTQ)\n- **Algorithms**: SmoothQuant outlier migration + Activation-aware Weight Quantization (AWQ)\n- **Precisions**: INT4 AWQ / FP8 AIE-ML v2 graph export with $<0.5\\%$ accuracy drop\n- **Hardware Target**: AMD Versal Gen 2 AI Engines (AIE-ML v2)\n- **Framework**: AMD Quark + Brevitas PyTorch Quantization",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage4",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 4 | Lock-Free Shared Memory & Hard RT Scheduling",
      "x": 680,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage4-iceoryx2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udce6 STAGE 4A | Iceoryx2 Zero-Copy Shared Memory\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/03-iceoryx2-zero-copy-ipc/README|Open Cookbook 03 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Zero-Copy POSIX Shared Memory IPC\n- **Transport**: POSIX shared memory (`/dev/shm`) lock-free wait-free ring buffer\n- **Transfer Latency**: $0.85\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ for 4K video frames ($0\\text{ memory copies}$)\n- **Latency Jitter**: P99 variance $< 0.05\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ across multi-process perception pipelines\n- **Rust Implementation**: Safe shared memory loan-and-publish semantics (`main.rs`)",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage4-scheduler",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u23f1\ufe0f STAGE 4B | Real-Time RMS & EDF Scheduler\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/15-realtime-rms-edf-scheduler/README|Open Cookbook 15 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Real-Time Task Scheduling Engine\n- **Static Policy**: Rate Monotonic Scheduling (RMS) with $U \\le n(2^{1/n}-1)$ bound\n- **Dynamic Policy**: Earliest Deadline First (EDF) with optimal $U \\le 1.0$ bound\n- **Deterministic Simulation**: Millisecond tick preemption modeling with zero deadline misses\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/real-time-systems/README|Real-Time Systems Playbook]]",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage4-frameworks",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f MIDDLEWARE | Iceoryx2 & Zenoh\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[frameworks/iceoryx2|Open Iceoryx2 Framework Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Inter-Process & Network Middleware\n- **Onboard IPC**: Iceoryx2 shared memory on local compute nodes\n- **Vehicle-to-Cloud / V2X**: Zenoh zero-overhead network protocol for DDS/ROS 2 bridges\n- **Integration**: Micro-ROS and ROS 2 RMW middleware plugins\n- **License**: Apache-2.0 / MIT License",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage5",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 5 | Target Silicon Hardware Platforms",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage5-orin",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 HARDWARE | NVIDIA Jetson Orin / Thor\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[hardware/nvidia-jetson-orin|Open Jetson Orin Hardware Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Edge GPU Specification\n- **Compute**: Up to 275 INT8 TOPS @ 60 W (AGX Orin) / 1,000 TFLOPS (Thor)\n- **Memory**: 64 GB 256-bit LPDDR5 with 204.8 GB/s unified memory bandwidth\n- **Software Stack**: JetPack 6/7, TensorRT 10, DeepStream 7, VPI zero-copy\n- **Mission Profile**: Automotive perception, robotic navigation, smart city vision",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage5-versal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 HARDWARE | AMD Versal AI Edge Gen 2\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[hardware/amd-versal-ai-edge-gen2|Open Versal Gen 2 Hardware Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Heterogeneous Adaptive SoC\n- **Processors**: Dual Cortex-A78AE + Cortex-R52 Lockstep + AIE-ML v2 Tiles\n- **Determinism**: Hard real-time execution with zero OS scheduling jitter\n- **Synthesis**: AMD Vitis AI & Quark PTQ graph compilation\n- **Safety Profile**: Functional safety certifiable for ISO 26262 ASIL-D",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage5-zynq",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 HARDWARE | AMD Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoC\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[hardware/amd-zynq-ultrascale-plus|Open Zynq UltraScale+ Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Low-Power Edge MPSoC\n- **Architecture**: Quad ARM Cortex-A53 + Dual Cortex-R5F + 16nm FPGA Fabric\n- **Custom Logic**: Custom Deep Learning Processing Units (DPU) synthesized in logic fabric\n- **Direct Ingestion**: Sub-millisecond direct FPGA sensor ingestion & motor drive\n- **Thermal Stability**: Operates across $-40^\\circ\\text{C}$ to $+125^\\circ\\text{C}$ industrial temperature",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
